# 统一换行符：仓库内一律 LF，避免 Windows / macOS 侧 checkout 后
# 出现「整树已修改但内容相同」的 CRLF 假改动（见 AGENT.md / workspace.md）。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件不参与文本转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.db binary
*.sqlite binary
*.sqlite3 binary
*.gz binary
*.tgz binary
*.zip binary
*.pdf binary
